      "text": "## John Harrison (1693–1776): The Clockmaker"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MARINE-CHRONOMETER.md#019",
      "path": [
        "04-MARINE-CHRONOMETER.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
