        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Watchmaking - 04 The Marine Chronometer",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. GRASSHOPPER ESCAPEMENT (Harrison's invention):\n   No lubrication required (pivoting on spring tensioned points)\n   Extremely precise geometry\n   (see detailed description below)"
    },
